WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.830
Does anyone have any other suggestions?

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:42.990
YES! I DO!

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:43.830
Koyama-kun.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:45.410
A maid stall!

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.120
Didn't we tell you not to suggest any more maid-related ideas?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.040
WHY NOT?!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.750
Maids are Japan's treasure!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.130
Oh dear. I knew you'd fight.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.010
To be honest, I have a favor to ask of Class A.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.260
Student Council Presents
Ultra Haunted House

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:04.810
Why don't you work on the Student Council's Ultra Haunted House with us?

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.980
An Exciting Reality

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.360
Graveyard Zone

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.230
Hospital Zone

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.230
Midpoint

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.110
Abandoned School Zone

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.480
Entrance

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:11.360
This was rumored to be a haunted house.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:11.360
Student

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:11.360
Council

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:11.360
Presents

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.190
Student Council Presents

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.190
Ultra Haunted House

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:22.830
Even if the Student Council is making the suggestion, can we really do this?

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.240
I'm a bit worried about this...

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.250
Dougi!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.370
Yes? Do you see a problem with it, Kayama-kun?

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.460
I propose that the haunted house have a female guide...

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.470
wearing a maid costume!!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.010
YEAH!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.840
Well said, Yuusuke!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.010
Objection!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.220
We'll never allow you to oppress us!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.100
That's right!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.020
Get away from us! You're enemies of all women!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.100
One, two...

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.190
GET OUT!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:59.450
GET OUT! GET OUT! GET OUT!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.820
GET OUT! GET OUT!

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.490
All right. That's enough, everyone.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.370
I won't give up on this. Not even if it costs me my life!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.000
THAT'S RIGHT!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.010
Why is it always like this?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.220
We'll never get anything done like this.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.260
Um... Excuse me...

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.010
Everyone...

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:25.760
Do you have a minute?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.350
If you have any suggestions, you need to bring them up during our meetings.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.610
You need to explain it in detail, so everyone can understand what you want.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:37.860
Yeah...

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:43.490
Why don't we ask the boys for their opinion first?

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:50.200
We should work together on it for the benefit of our class.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.210
I-I guess.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:58.090
Since we have the famous Sakurai-kun here, we should be able to accomplish anything.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.510
Well...

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.840
She's right!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.970
Just leave it to me!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.470
Let's continue our meeting!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.610
I don't think I'm doing enough for my class.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.780
Cut it out!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.450
Oh, Sensei! Goodbye!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.370
Goodbye.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.120
Take care on your way home.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.370
Okay!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.250
Lucky her.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:48.180
It's not sharp enough to cut the wind.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.350
Take that! And that!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.520
And that!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.810
Please watch where you swing that thing, Akaboshi-sensei!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:06.280
K-Kasuga-kun. I'd like to talk to you about your essay...

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:07.780
Okay.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:12.540
I asked you to choose a topic that had recently moved you emotionally.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:17.580
You wrote an essay about a boy who hit you in the chest during volleyball practice.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:20.290
Note: Kasuga misinterpreted "muno wo utsu," which means "to be moved emotionally," because it also means "to hit someone in the chest".

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.670
Well...

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.380
You...

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.050
You don't understand me at all!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:29.600
Because of you, I can't concentrate on my teaching! I'll use what's left of my life to...

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.810
Well, you've been saying that you don't have long to live since last year.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.480
Don't you agree, Watatake-sensei?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.190
I-I guess so...

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.690
What was Iyagen-sensei talking about?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.530
Sorry to call you out while you were practicing.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.700
To be honest, I need you to wear this.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.540
Wh-What is this?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.460
You bear the weight of the swim club's future.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:02.710
For your sake, Yayoi Mina, I have created the Super Attractive Swimsuit!

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.800
Here! Practice in this from today onwards!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:12.010
Um... The design goes against school regulations...

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.600
Regulations, you say?

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.520
You can't accomplish anything if you're afraid of school regulations!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:22.060
You have to violate school regulations once in a while if you want to improve!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.860
Don't you agree, Watatake-sensei?

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.900
W-Well... I guess so...

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.830
Amamiya Sayuri.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:52.260
She's attractive, she's diligent in everything she does, and she does everything perfectly.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.390
She's a real perfectionist.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:01.900
Our play in this year's Culture Festival is sure to be a success!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.400
I don't know why, but I'm exhausted.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.570
She's attractive, diligent, and does everything perfectly.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.120
I'm nothing compared to her.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.200
You must've worked hard.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.580
Please have some coffee.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.250
Th-Thank you very much, Matsuoka-sensei.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.390
Oh! It's good.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.650
I'm having fun tonight too!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:53.990
You always say that, so I can never understand you. You're really drunk, aren't you?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.080
Don't say that, Hoshino-sensei!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm not drunk!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.410
Anyone can tell that you're drunk!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.330
Aren't you feeling well, Watatake-sensei?

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.290
O-Oh, I'm fine.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.170
If it's not a physical problem, then it must be an emotional one.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.010
Are you worried about your love life?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Hoshino-sensei!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.100
What do you think of me as a teacher?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.980
What is it? What's wrong?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.020
No, it's not like that...

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.480
I want to know what other people think.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.280
Watatake-sensei is a wonderful teacher!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.610
What's with this drunk?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:40.660
Well, that's why I really like drinking with other ladies!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.910
H-Hey!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.500
You've drunk way too much!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.750
Hey! Let me go!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:00.760
Well then...

