All right!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.780
Thank you,Sumio.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:11.000
You're welcome!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.790
T-h-a-n-k y-o-u.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:18.250
Thank you.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.250
Congratulations on getting
them all right, Haru.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.430
Thank you.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:23.430
Let's do our best together.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.510
Let's do our best together.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.980
I'm Kinosaki Fumi.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.530
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love! I'm Watatake Haruka.

