She seems much more energetic than usual today.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.300
She's full of energy today.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.180
Yeah.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:09.390
Maybe the springtime of her life has come.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.100
Springtime?

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:12.770
I'm saying...

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.770
that she's got a boyfriend!

