What?!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:24.490
Did you enjoy
that movie?

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.490
Yes. It was
hilarious.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.990
Then I guess I
should go see it too?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.830
Let me know if you enjoyed it.

