Staff Room

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.540
Take that! And that!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.550
I... I don't like this sound...

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.260
Take that!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:47.930
Hey!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.640
How in the world?!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.180
Put your back into it, Akaoni-sensei!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.180
 Note:"Akaoni" (Red Devil) is a pun on his real name, "Akaboshi" (Red Star).

