Did she take some effective medicine this morning?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:26.630
Haru: We're NOT gonna lose!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:26.630
Sumio: The real battle starts now, Haru!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:27.840
We did it!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.930
I'll celebrate our victory tonight!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.190
I didn't think that you'd be
worried about anything, Haru.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.350
Oh my!

