They don't trust you?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:29.070
I'm not confident as a woman.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.070
 Really? I think you're an honest
and attractive lady.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.830
I'm not confident as a woman.

