Sumio-san has logged out.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.910
Note: The chalkboard has an English lesson.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.130
Why did you log out, Sumio-kun?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.130
