Is Adachi Sumio the name of Amamiya Sayuri's avatar?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.120
Watatake-sensei.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.000
What's wrong?

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.710
I-It's nothing.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.290
Hey! Sensei!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.130
Did something happen, Matsuoka-sensei?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.550
I don't know.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:02.890
Amamiya-san.

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:03.890
How's it going?

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.430
Oh, Aoba-kun.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:07.980
How should I put this?

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.150
I'm not too good at this.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.570
It looks like a lot of fun.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:20.570
Kurotokage-sensei said that playing this online game is good acting practice.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.820
Yo, before anything else, you have something important to talk about, right Riku?

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.790
Oh, that's right.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.830
I need to talk to you about something else.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.290
