00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.750
I've figured out most of it, so let's talk somewhere else.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.590
I'm so stupid.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:48.480
I don't have a boyfriend, and I can't even organize a lesson plan.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:57.400
Maybe I should quit my job as a teacher and go back home.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.620
