00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:09.960
I should have found out who that intelligent and calm boy was.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.040
But...

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.500
I'm still not certain who he is.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:25.680
He's not here.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.600
Not here either.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:29.680
Or here.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.810
He's nowhere to be found.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.750
I'm just not motivated at all.

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:56.880
All right!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.470
Happy Birthday!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.430
Wh-What's this all about?

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.940
Haruka-sensei, thank you for always being so cheerful.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:18.230
We wanted to make it up to you for causing so much trouble and tell you how we felt.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:23.200
The whole class discussed it, and we decided to celebrate your birthday.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.870
I'm flattered...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.450
We thought you'd find out sooner or later, so we were really nervous.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.080
You've been acting strangely lately, Haruka-sensei, so we thought this would be nice.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.710
Really?

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.590
This is from all of us.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.590
Happy Birthday!

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.060
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.110
Geez. Everyone's so happy!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.780
Um... Amamiya-san.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:06.870
Yes?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.910
It's about that game you were playing.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:10.950
Game?

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:15.080
Oh, that school simulation game that
Kurotokage-sensei recommended to me?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.040
Kurotokage-sensei recommended that to you?

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.800
I just started playing it recently, so I'm not too familiar with it.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.880
So, you weren't Sumio-kun?

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.680
Don't worry about it!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.970
It's nothing.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:35.520
Well, my homeroom teacher is a very curious lady.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.150
It's so nice being a teacher!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:52.490
Hey, hey!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.580
Don't spill any more coffee, okay?

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:08.220
It took me a while to come up with the name "Adachi Sumio."

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:11.050
Adam Smith

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:14.600
I might get to see her again.

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.620
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:41.790
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.220
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:53.970
This love began.

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:59.940
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:06.360
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.940 --> 00:23:11.870
I start to smile.

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:16.910
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:24.040
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:29.800
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:35.390
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:42.150
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.530
Next Episode Preview

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:52.410
Geez.

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.070
What's wrong, Yayoi-san?

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:55.490
Oh, Harinui-sensei!

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:56.990
I can't sew this.

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.490
Oh, this?

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.120
Like this, see?

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.080
Isn't it easy?

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.790
Thank you so much!

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:04.170
You really are good at this!

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.460
I don't look like it, but I am a teacher!

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:11.670
And if you're single for a long time, you get used to it.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:14.680
Next on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.850
An Exciting Moment.

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:16.890
Watch it!

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:19.600
Huh? What did you just say, Sensei?
